	"data": "Room 2.0 — Multiplayer Networking Research\n\nResearch into two multiplayer modes for Room 2.0: co-located shared AR and remote networked visitors. Includes findings on OpenXR spatial entity sharing, Godot networking options, backend architecture changes, and vocabulary extension analysis.\n\nTable of Contents\nMode 1: Shared AR Space (Co-located Quest-to-Quest)\nMode 2: Networked Visitors (Remote VR/Desktop → Host AR)\nJSON-LD Vocabulary Extension Analysis\nBackend Architecture Changes\nWebRTC vs…",
